{"title":"Career roadmap · Article Assistant","role":"Article Assistant","summary":"An Article Assistant is a trainee working under a practicing Chartered Accountant during the practical-training stage of the CA pathway, gaining experience in accounting, audit, taxation, financial reporting, compliance and related professional services.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Accounting & Taxation (Integrated with CA/CMA/CS)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The important distinction is that Article Assistant is a CA-training designation, not simply a normal B.Com job title. The exact practical-training structure, eligibility and duration are governed by the current ICAI regulations.","url":"https://www.icai.org/"},{"type":"note","label":"Career-route check","text":"Strongly aligned with the integrated B.Com Accounting & Taxation pathway."},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com + CA pathway","CA practical training/Article Assistant","CA qualification","Senior/Managerial/Advisory roles"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build accounting, audit and taxation fundamentals and progress through the CA pathway"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Become a qualified CA and specialise in audit, tax, FP&A, consulting, risk or financial reporting"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Audit Manager, Tax Manager, Finance Manager, Controller or specialist advisory roles"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move into senior finance leadership, partner-track practice, CFO-track roles or specialist advisory"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Accounting foundation"},{"text":"Financ